  "releaseNotes": "# Patch notes for 144.0.155\n\nThese patch notes summarize the changes from version 143.0.162.\n\nAdded 2 new APIs:\n* ProjectChargeCode.CreateProjectChargeCode (POST /api/data/projects/chargecodes)\n* ProjectStatus.CreateProjectStatus (POST /api/data/projects/statuses)\n\nChanges to data models:\n* ProjectChargeCodeDto: Added new field `isActive`\n* ProjectTemplateDto: Added new field `ownerId`\n* ProjectTemplateDto: Added new field `createDate`\n* TimesheetDto: Added new field `approvalStatusId`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `description`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `isAdmin`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `isCustom`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `isGlobalAdmin`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `isGuest`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `isDefault`\n* UserRoleDto: Added new field `permissions`",
